    "title": "进货退货单",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%80%80%E8%B4%A7%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">新增进货退货单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%80%80%E8%B4%A7%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>（1）路径：底部【进货】-顶部【退货】-右下角【退货】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/35c969ede0b2a75c89aeac04e5fad00b.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>（2）选择退货的供应商和退货商品信息，然后点击保存即可。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/07a3290a1a18d7f4a79b8f8012ee6510.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>（3）保存成功后可以点击【打印标签】，就可以打印商品的标签，点击底部的打印按钮可以打印该单据。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/1f3b404a5ba92b3816c8a0e90b700af9.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%80%80%E8%B4%A7%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">修改进货退货单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%80%80%E8%B4%A7%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>进货退货单列表点击对应的退货单，然后进货到退货单详情界面，然后点击底部的修改按钮即可修改单据。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/c0619332092ac6048c931f11ee72d823.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%92%8C%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%9F%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%80%80%E8%B4%A7%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">复制和作废进货退货单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%92%8C%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%9F%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%80%80%E8%B4%A7%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>在进货退货单详情界面，点击右上角的【...】按钮，就可以点击复制本单和作废单据。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/d9e61ef0c282511df31e1dba635ce2ff.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
